0..78 Comment "//! A conditional, `if c { t } else { e }`: the case of its condition over the"
79..159 Comment "//! two booleans, the true branch first. The condition is a computation the case"
160..234 Comment "//! binds, as `while` binds its own, and each branch is a block whose last"
235..314 Comment "//! computation is the conditional\'s answer. The derived form is the usual one:"
315..357 Comment "//! `if` as the eliminator of the booleans"
358..436 Comment "//! [Levy-2003-callbypushvalue_functional_imperative_synthesis], § 2.3, where"
437..476 Comment "//! the case of a sum is a computation."
